# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile: only what the web app and the Go binary are built from. Everything else, including
# local data, secrets, dependencies and earlier build output, stays out of the image build.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!migrations/
!web/

# Built inside the image (web/dist/placeholder stays: the Go code embeds it)
web/node_modules
web/dist/app

# Never sent to the builder, even inside the directories above
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/pb_data
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.pmtiles
**/*.mbtiles
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
